WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:03.040
These cuts are blood money.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.020
People will die.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.320
Let's be very clear:

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:13.780
Senate Republicans are paying for tax cuts
for the wealthy with American lives.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.280
People need kidneys.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.340
It's sad but decreed.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:19.180
Yet this Senator's hoarding one more than
she needs.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.820
I offer this bill and I hope you'll vote aye

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:24.520
unless of course you just want people to die.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.780
Traffic deaths have many crying with fear.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.400
Over thirty thousand people are dying each
year.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.280
This modest change I propose must be applied

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.079
unless of course you just want people to die.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.580
Alcohol deaths are exceeding comparisons,

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:39.800
black people, white people, native American.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.560
We need to ban alcohol, it can't be denied,

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.300
unless of course you just want people to die.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.680
Murders are bad, they have no defenders.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.200
Yet many are committed by repeat offenders.

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:53.180
I say lifetime in prison whatever the crime,

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.880
unless of course you just want people to die.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.200
I don't have a bill, or a groan to detail,

00:00:58.219 --> 00:01:00.579
I just need a short clip for my donor email.

00:01:00.579 --> 00:01:02.199
Tim there's blood on your hands!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.540
You want people to die!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:04.460
That good? Cool.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.560
Tim, dinner at five?

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:06.060
Yeah.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.620
The car deaths I mentioned are terrible stuff.

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:10.940
Doesn't seem one seat-belt is ever enough.

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:14.020
You must vote for my act so that fewer will
cry,

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.780
unless of course you just want people to die.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:18.810
The carbs, the container, we cannot ignore

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:21.600
whipped cream's killing more people than ever
before.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.920
This bill would be passed and be ratified

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.660
if those people that didn't want people to
die.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.240
Why not weigh all the costs?

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.510
the effects, the results.

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:31.980
Empathize with each other as if we were adults.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.600
Use our brains to craft arguments not vilify.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:35.880
See that freedom's a trade-off.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.500
You want 
people to die!

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:39.960
I tried.

